      <tei:div type="colophon" subtype="introduction">
        <tei:p>This prayer for the country is found in the Siddur Sephat Emeth, which was published by the venerable Rödelheim publishing house in Frankfurt in 1938. This was probably the last siddur ever published in pre-Holocaust Germany. This prayer is full of pathos and yearning, and in a time of rising government-sponsored antisemitism worldwide it’s worth keeping in mind. English translation is original.</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
      <j:endConditional target="#osp_33086_introduction"/>
